# Git History Rewrite Notice

**Date of rewrite:** 2026-09-10 (UTC)
**Ship:** `v58.13.132cw` (APK purge) + `v58.13.132cx` (rebuild consolidation) + `v58.13.132cy` (force-push to GitHub)

## What happened

The git history of this repository was rewritten to purge ~452 MB of Android APK build artefacts (`backend/static/downloads/*.apk`) from every commit that ever touched them. The APKs are pre-built binaries produced by EAS Build — they don't belong in source control and were making the repo unpushable.

- **Before rewrite:** ~132 MiB packed + ~389 MiB loose objects.
- **After rewrite:** ~150 MiB packed + 0 loose. **Net .git footprint reduction ≈ 370 MB.**
- Every one of the 728 pre-rewrite commits was rehashed; **every SHA in `main` has changed.**

